    "Kept as a regression fixture because it exposed two classifier bugs that the",
    "synthetic fixture never would have:",
    "",
    "  1. Exact op matching dropped browser.DNS, browser.TLS/SSL, ui.webvital.cls,",
    "     ui.react.update, db.redis into 'unclassified' — an incomplete lookup",
    "     table reading as a customer finding. Now longest-prefix matched.",
