    "     business instrumentation. It is SDK-derived code-level function tracing.",
    "     `items_added_to_cart` and `processCheckout` are the real business spans.",
    "",
    "attributes[] is intentionally empty: trace-items/attributes/ needs a token and",
    "is not exposed as an MCP tool, so this fixture covers span classification only."
  ],
